      "content": "From these one can compute the $(H_0^{(1)})_{nn'}$, $(H_0^{(2)})_{nn'}$, ..., $i$e the matrix elements $\\left(\\frac{\\partial H_0}{\\partial \\xi_i}\\right)_{nn'}$, $\\left(\\frac{\\partial^2 H_0}{\\partial \\xi_i \\partial \\xi_j}\\right)_{nn'}$, ... We will later apply these formulas.$^3$",
